  "notes": [
    "No new Cell implementation, native registry, method guard or GC policy change.",
    "Old Store-local Cell constructors/tagged restoration removed; snapshots containing that native representation require rebuilding.",
    "Explicit fact-backed Cell identity/alias restoration and invalid-tag refusal checked through native owner messages; ordinary and fact Cells also passed mapped/rebuilt recovery.",
